---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Terms of Service" path="/terms/" trail={[{ name: "Terms", path: "/terms/" }]}
  description="Terms of use for the IT Code Lab website and free tools.">
  <article class="wrap section max-w-3xl">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="lede speakable mt-4">These terms cover use of this website and its free tools. Paid services are governed by a separate written agreement.</p>
    <div class="prose-lab mt-10">
      <h2>Use of the site</h2>
      <p>You may use this site and the Lab tools for lawful business purposes. Do not attempt to disrupt the site or its forms.</p>
      <h2>No guarantees</h2>
      <p>Tools such as the ROAS calculator are informational. They do not guarantee advertising or business results.</p>
      <h2>Products in development</h2>
      <p>Descriptions of products marked "in development" or "early access" are design intent, not a commitment to availability dates.</p>
      <h2>Compliance is yours</h2>
      <p>If you use our products, you remain responsible for complying with laws that apply to your outreach, including DPDP, CAN-SPAM and PECR. Nothing here is legal advice.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms can be sent through the contact page.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
